    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afterblast is an exhilarating, high-octane multiplayer first-person shooter that takes action to new heights with its dynamic parkour mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate through crumbling urban landscapes, leaping across rooftops and engaging in combat with a diverse arsenal of weapons and gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a fast-paced adrenaline rush where strategy and agility are key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're dodging enemy fire or performing parkour maneuvers, Afterblast delivers a  experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Join the fight, master your parkour skills, and dominate the battlefield with the ultimate test of reflexes and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the newly added gamemodes, Capture the Flag and Deathmatch, as well as team-based modes. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Afterblast is an exhilarating, high-octane multiplayer first-person shooter that takes action to new heights with its dynamic parkour mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate through crumbling urban landscapes, leaping across rooftops and engaging in combat with a diverse arsenal of weapons and gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a fast-paced adrenaline rush where strategy and agility are key. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're dodging enemy fire or performing parkour maneuvers, Afterblast delivers a  experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat. Join the fight, master your parkour skills, and dominate the battlefield with the ultimate test of reflexes and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the newly added gamemodes, Capture the Flag and Deathmatch, as well as team-based modes. </p>",
